    "text": "To determine Julie's monthly salary, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Calculate Julie's daily earnings.\n2. Determine her weekly earnings.\n3. Calculate her monthly earnings, considering she was absent for one day.\n\n**Step 1: Calculate Julie's daily earnings.**\nJulie's hourly rate is $5 and she works 8 hours a day. Therefore, her daily earnings are:\n\\[ 5 \\text{ dollars/hour} \\times 8 \\text{ hours/day} = 40 \\text{ dollars/day} \\]\n\n**Step 2: Determine her weekly earnings.**\nJulie works 6 days a week. Therefore, her weekly earnings are:\n\\[ 40 \\text{ dollars/day} \\times 6 \\text{ days/week} = 240 \\text{ dollars/week} \\]\n\n**Step 3: Calculate her monthly earnings, considering she was absent for one day.**\nSince Julie was absent for one day, she worked for 5 days in a week. Therefore, her monthly earnings are:\n\\[ 240 \\text{ dollars/week} \\times 4 \\text{ weeks/month} = 960 \\text{ dollars/month} \\]\n\nThus, Julie's monthly salary is \\(\\boxed{960}\\).",
